  "extract_html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"ib-wrap\" style=\"width:300px\">\n   \n<aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-midnightblue pi-layout-default\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"Box title\">Kinetic Conversion</h2>\n\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\" data-source=\"image\">\n\t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/d/d8/797024-87276_104898_maelstrom_super_super.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20121019183936\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"797024-87276 104898 maelstrom super super\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/d/d8/797024-87276_104898_maelstrom_super_super.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/258?cb=20121019183936\" srcset=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/d/d8/797024-87276_104898_maelstrom_super_super.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/258?cb=20121019183936 1x, https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/d/d8/797024-87276_104898_maelstrom_super_super.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20121019183936 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" data-relevant=\"1\" alt=\"797024-87276 104898 maelstrom super super\" width=\"258\" height=\"500\" data-image-key=\"797024-87276_104898_maelstrom_super_super.jpg\" data-image-name=\"797024-87276 104898 maelstrom super super.jpg\" />\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure>\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Maelstrom (Marvel Comics) can absorb, channel, and otherwise manipulate vast amounts of kinetic energy and redirect the energy transferred into energy blasts</h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Row 1 info\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Power/Ability to:</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Absorb/convert kinetic energy.</div>\n</div>\n</aside>\n</div> \n<p>The power to <b>absorb kinetic energy and convert it into other types of energy.</b> Sub-power of <a href=\"/wiki/Kinetic_Energy_Manipulation\" title=\"Kinetic Energy Manipulation\">Kinetic Energy Manipulation</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Kinetic_Energy_Absorption\" title=\"Kinetic Energy Absorption\">Kinetic Energy Absorption</a>. Variation of <a href=\"/wiki/Energy_Conversion\" title=\"Energy Conversion\">Energy Conversion</a>.\n</p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Also_Called\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Also Called</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Capabilities\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Capabilities</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Applications\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Applications</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Associations\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Associations</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Limitations\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Limitations</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Known_Users\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Known Users</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#Known_Objects\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">7</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Known Objects</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-8\"><a href=\"#Gallery\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">8</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Gallery</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-9\"><a href=\"#Videos\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">9</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Videos</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Also_Called\">Also Called</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FKinetic_Conversion%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D1&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>Kinetic Energy Conversion</li>\n<li>Kinetic Transduction</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Capabilities\">Capabilities</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FKinetic_Conversion%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D2&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The user can absorb and channel kinetic energy and convert it into other types of energy (light, heat, sound, etc.).\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Applications\">Applications</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FKinetic_Conversion%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D3&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Bio-Energetic_Sourcing\" title=\"Bio-Energetic Sourcing\">Bio-Energetic Sourcing</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Bio-Capacitor\" title=\"Bio-Capacitor\">Bio-Capacitor</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Bio-Energetic_Accumulation\" title=\"Bio-Energetic Accumulation\">Bio-Energetic Accumulation</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Bio-Energetic_Conversion\" title=\"Bio-Energetic Conversion\">Bio-Energetic Conversion</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Bio-Energetic_Transduction\" title=\"Bio-Energetic Transduction\">Bio-Energetic Transduction</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Bio-Ionic_Dynamo\" title=\"Bio-Ionic Dynamo\">Bio-Ionic Dynamo</a></li></ul></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Bio-Energizing\" title=\"Bio-Energizing\">Bio-Energizing</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Living_Power_Plant\" title=\"Living Power Plant\">Living Power Plant</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Bio-Energy_Concentration\" title=\"Bio-Energy Concentration\">Bio-Energy Concentration</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Electrical_Conversion\" title=\"Electrical Conversion\">Electrical Conversion</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Electromagnetic_Conversion\" title=\"Electromagnetic Conversion\">Electromagnetic Conversion</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Energy_Emulation\" title=\"Energy Emulation\">Energy Emulation</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Energy_Signature_Alternation\" title=\"Energy Signature Alternation\">Energy Signature Alternation</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Kinetic_Amplification\" title=\"Kinetic Amplification\">Kinetic Amplification</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Heat_Conversion\" title=\"Heat Conversion\">Heat Conversion</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Kinetic_Accumulation\" title=\"Kinetic Accumulation\">Kinetic Accumulation</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Kinetic_Concentration\" title=\"Kinetic Concentration\">Kinetic Concentration</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Kinetic_Energizing\" title=\"Kinetic Energizing\">Kinetic Energizing</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Bio-Kinetic_Dynamo\" title=\"Bio-Kinetic Dynamo\">Bio-Kinetic Dynamo</a></li></ul></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Kinetic_Replication\" title=\"Kinetic Replication\">Kinetic Replication</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Personal_Kinetic_Energy\" title=\"Personal Kinetic Energy\">Personal Kinetic Energy</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Bio-Energetic_Physician\" title=\"Bio-Energetic Physician\">Bio-Energetic Physician</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Personal_Electromagnetism\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Personal Electromagnetism\">Personal Electromagnetism</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Personal_Heat\" title=\"Personal Heat\">Personal Heat</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Personal_Thermal_Radiation\" title=\"Personal Thermal Radiation\">Personal Thermal Radiation</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Personal_Particle_Vibration\" title=\"Personal Particle Vibration\">Personal Particle Vibration</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Personal_Sound\" title=\"Personal Sound\">Personal Sound</a></li></ul></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Sound_Conversion\" title=\"Sound Conversion\">Sound Conversion</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Kinetic_Capacitor\" title=\"Kinetic Capacitor\">Store</a> and convert kinetic energy into other types of energy, such as:\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Freezing\" title=\"Freezing\">Cold</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Ice_Generation\" title=\"Ice Generation\">Ice</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Cosmic_Generation\" title=\"Cosmic Generation\">Cosmic</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Gravity_Generation\" title=\"Gravity Generation\">Gravity</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Space_Energy_Generation\" title=\"Space Energy Generation\">Space</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Time_Energy_Generation\" title=\"Time Energy Generation\">Time</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Lunar_Generation\" title=\"Lunar Generation\">Lunar</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Solar_Generation\" title=\"Solar Generation\">Solar</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Stellar_Generation\" title=\"Stellar Generation\">Stellar</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Electromagnetism_Generation\" title=\"Electromagnetism Generation\">Electromagnetism</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Electricity_Generation\" title=\"Electricity Generation\">Electricity</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Magnetism_Generation\" title=\"Magnetism Generation\">Magnetism</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Heat_Generation\" title=\"Heat Generation\">Heat</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Fire_Generation\" title=\"Fire Generation\">Fire</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Ionic_Generation\" title=\"Ionic Generation\">Ion</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Plasma_Generation\" title=\"Plasma Generation\">Plasma</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Light_Generation\" title=\"Light Generation\">Light</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Nuclear_Generation\" title=\"Nuclear Generation\">Nuclear</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Radiation_Generation\" title=\"Radiation Generation\">Radiation</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Kinetic_Energy_Generation\" title=\"Kinetic Energy Generation\">Kinetics</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Sound_Wave_Generation\" title=\"Sound Wave Generation\">Sound</a></li></ul></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Associations\">Associations</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FKinetic_Conversion%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D4&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Electrical_Conversion\" title=\"Electrical Conversion\">Electrical Conversion</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Energy_Manipulation\" title=\"Energy Manipulation\">Energy Manipulation</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Kinetic_Energy_Manipulation\" title=\"Kinetic Energy Manipulation\">Kinetic Energy Manipulation</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Psionic_Energy_Conversion\" title=\"Psionic Energy Conversion\">Psionic Energy Conversion</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Sound_Conversion\" title=\"Sound Conversion\">Sound Conversion</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Limitations\">Limitations</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FKinetic_Conversion%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D5&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>May be limited to a certain type of energy</li>\n<li>Users need kinetic energy to activate their full potential</li>\n<li>User cannot convert kinetic energy into matter (such as electrons).</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Known_Users\">Known Users</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FKinetic_Conversion%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D6&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"https://denma.fandom.com/wiki/Characters%23Other_characters\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:c:denma:Characters\">Yellow hair</a> (<i>Denma</i>); via Energy Transfer <a href=\"https://denma.fandom.com/wiki/Quanx\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:c:denma:Quanx\">Quanx</a> ability</li>\n<li>Scott Duval/Powerplex (Image Comics/Invincible)</li>\n<li>Maelstrom (<i>Marvel Comics</i>)</li>\n<li>Maverick (<i>Marvel Comics</i>)</li>\n<li>Sebastian Shaw (<i>Marvel Comics</i>)</li>\n<li>Bishop (<i>Marvel Comics</i>)</li>\n<li>Strong Guy (<i>Marvel Comics</i>)</li>\n<li>Blocks (<i>Marvel Comics</i>)</li>\n<li>Cole Young (<i>Mortal Kombat film series</i>)</li>\n<li>The Amazing Bubbles (<i>Wild Cards</i>)</li>\n<li>Tengu Brunch/Buranchi (<i>Toriko</i>)</li>\n<li>Gabe (<i>Inheritors</i>)</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Known_Objects\">Known Objects</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsecti